  "notes": "こなす means to handle, manage, or master something.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: Transitive ({他動詞|たどうし})\n- Pattern: Xをこなす\n\nUSAGE:\n- Implies competent handling or skilled management\n- Often suggests dealing with a large volume or difficulty\n- Can imply getting through or completing tasks\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {仕事|しごと}をこなす: handle work\n- {量|りょう}をこなす: get through volume\n- {役割|やくわり}をこなす: fulfill a role\n- うまくこなす: handle well\n- {難|むずか}しい{仕事|しごと}をこなす: handle difficult work\n\nWRITING:\n- Usually written in hiragana\n- Can be written as {熟|こな}す (rarely used)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {処理|しょり}する: to process, handle\n- {対応|たいおう}する: to deal with\n- {使|つか}いこなす: to master using",
